cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Core temperature estimation in a cylindrical lithium-ion cell: analysis code,
  identifiability study, and scored predictions
message: >-
  If you use this software or its results, please cite it. If you use the
  experimental datasets it analyses, cite those separately -- see DATA.md.
